{
  "id": "MRK.15",
  "number": "15",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Mariko 15",
  "verseCount": 47,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo obwire bwakeire buti, abakuhani bakuru, n'abagurusi, n'abegesa b'Amateka, n'orukiiko rwona bakiika. Baboha Yesu bamutwalira Pilato bamumunaga omu mikono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato abaza Yesu ati, “Iwe oba mukama w'Abayahudi?” Yesu amuhorora ati, “Okwo wakigamba nikwo kili.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuhani bakuru bamutoijera bingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato ashuba amubaza ati, “Toina kyakuhorora? Olebe okwo ebyo balikukutoijera bili bingi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Yesu tiyayeyongeire kuhorora, ekyo kitangaza Pilato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli kiro kikuru kya Pasika, Pilato yabataishuliraga omufungwa omoi owo bamushabaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu bashuuga ababaire bali omu kifungo, nibo balinya abaisire abantu omu bushengi, hakaba halimu omoi nayetwa Baraba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embaga eija ebanza kushaba Pilato kubagilira nk'okwo yabagiliraga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato abahorora ati, “Nimwenda mbataishulire Omukama w'Abayahudi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba akaba namanya okwo abakuhani bakuru bamulesire nibasindikwa eihagiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai abakuhani bakuru batamu abantu oruchuku kumugambira k'abataishulira Baraba, Yesu chei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato ashuba ababaza ati, “Isi aho omushaija owo mulikweta Mukama w'Abayahudi mugire ntai?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashuba bakunga bati, “Omubambe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato ababaza ati, “Aha kiki? Kabiki ak'akozire?” Kyonkai bonene bakunga bashagaho bati, “Omubambe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo Pilato agonza kushemeleza embaga, abataishulira Baraba; kyonkai kayaizire kutaishura Yesu kumubamba, abanza amutera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisherukare batahya Yesu omu kikaare (nigwo mwanya ogulikwetwa Puraitorio); beta omutwe gwona gw'abaisherukare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamujweka ebebo ya zambarau, basiba n'omukako gw'amahwa bagumutaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babanza kumumeleeza bakwese, “Kamelere Mukama w'Abayahudi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamuteza orubingo omu mutwe, bamuchwera ebichwanta, babandama bamuramya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabamazire kumujaamya bamujura ebebo ya zambarau, bamugaruraho emyendo eye. Bashuba bamufunya kugya kumubamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kababaire nibagenda omu muhanda bagimba omuhinguzi, Simoni owa Kirene, akaba naruga omu kyaro, bamutwaza omusaraba. N'iwe ishe Alekisanda na Rufusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baleta Yesu ahalikwetwa Goligota (nikwo kugir'oti omwanya gw'ekitwe ky'omuntu). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamuha edivai etabirainwe n'omubazi gwa mira, kyonkai tiyaginyoire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamubamba, babegana emyendoye, kyonkai bagitekera enshoga kumanya ogw'omuntu aratwara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zikaba zili saa ishatu za bwankya orwo bamubambire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'omushango ogwo bamutaireho bagumuhandikaho bati, “Omukama w'Abayahudi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamubamba n'abashuga babili, ogu bamuteka obulyo n'ondijo obumosho. [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho n'ebihandiko bitakatifu bigobelera ebilikugamba biti, “Bakamukwatirana n'abafakare.”] ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ababaire nibahingura bamuleerura nibachunda emitwe bakwese, “Mpahosi! Iwe ayagambiire kukambura Rwensinga okagyombekera ebiro bishatu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oyerokore oruge aha musaraba!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'abakuhani bakuru kutyo hamoi n'abegesa b'Amateka bamujamya omu fumoro bati, “Akarokora banu, wenene taina kwerokora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirisito Omukama wa Isiraeli, naruge aha musaraba twije tumwikilize.” N'ababambirwe nawe kwakwo bamujuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kazabaire esaa mukaga ensi yona ebambwa omwilima kugoba esaa mwenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha saa mwenda Yesu ataka n'eiraka lihango ati, “Eloi Eloi, lama sabakitani?” Nikwo kugir'oti, “Ruhanga wange, Ruhanga wange, wanagiraki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababaire bali aho kabakihuliire bagamba bati, “Leba, nayeta Eliya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu omoi airuka, akwata ekikunjuzo akitubika omu siki y'edivai, akitunga aha rubingo omuhaire kunywa, nagamba ati, “Katulinde tulebe nka Eliya araija akamuhanantura.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu ataaga muno, aho ahwamu omwoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orutimbe rwa Rwensinga rutagukamu kabili, kwema eiguru kwija ahansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho omukuru w'abaisherukare ayabaire ayemeleire amulebire, yaboine okwo yataka akashuba akahwamu omwoyo, agamba ati, “Mazimakwo omuntu ogu yaba ali Mwana wa Ruhanga!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakaba haliho n'abakazi balebeire harai, omuli abo akaba halimu Maria Magadalena, na Maria nyina Yakobo omuto na Yose, na Salome, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abamuhonderaga kwema Galilaya nibamujuna; n'abakazi abandi bangi ababaire baizire nawe kwema Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu bwaigoro kikaba kili kiro ky'okwetekateka, nikyo kiro kilikwebembera Sabato, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yozefu owa Arimatea, omutegeki w'ekitinwa omu rukiiko, kandi yategelezaga obukama bwa Ruhanga, ayeyemamu agya owa Pilato, amushaba omubili gwa Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato atangara nayebaza nka yafire. Ayeta omukuru w'abaisherukare, amubaza nka yafire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukuru w'abaisherukare kayamugambiire okwo yafire, aha Yozefu omubiligwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yozefu ogwo owa Arimatea agura ekirago kya kitaani, amuhanantura, amuzinga omu kirago kya kitaani ekyo, amuteka omu nyanga eyo wenene yashangirwe ayetemeire omu rwazi. Ahilingisa eibare lihango alikingisa enyanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maria Magadalena, na Maria nyina Yose, babona mbali Yesu yaziikwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
